        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_65"/>
        <dc:title>生成式人工智能赋能历史教学：价值、场景、挑战及应对</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>对历史教学而言，引入生成式人工智能不仅是响应国家发展战略的应有之义，而且是顺应课程改革、赋能课堂教学的必然要求。生成式人工智能是一把双刃剑，其可在拟定教学框架、设计学生活动、美化教学课件、优化教学语言、构建生成式课堂、生成评价试题等方面赋能历史教学，也可能带来产生误导、导致教师产生技术依赖、冲击历史教师角色定位、引发价值观导向偏差等问题。为此，历史教师要积极融入生成式人工智能时代、拓宽获取知识的路径、适应角色转变、坚持正确价值导向，以推动历史教学的创新发展。</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2024</dc:date>
        <z:language>汉语</z:language>
        <bib:pages>54-58</bib:pages>
    </bib:Article>
    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_207">
        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;Page 4: Optimizing Instructional Language&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;Evaluation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: var(--dsw-alias-label-primary)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leveraging generative artificial intelligence can breathe new life into the static texts of history textbooks. It transforms dry historical accounts into vivid narratives rich with detail and plot, and restores abstract causal patterns to the real choices made by individuals caught in the torrent of their times. What this approach awakens is not only students' curiosity about history but also their profound resonance with the human condition—allowing cold historical records to blossom with humanistic warmth, and truly revealing the charm and essence of history as a humanities discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(128, 0, 128)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:value>
    </bib:Memo>
    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_64">
        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21)&quot;&gt;Research on the classification and functions of educational digital tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:value>
    </bib:Memo>
